2. Using AWS Certificate Manager (ACM) we can request & manage SSL/TLS certificates. & attache to LB.
3. Two Types of Certificates :
   1. Public Certificate --->> used for public websites
   2. Private Certificate --->> used for internal applications
4. Regular Certificate --->> used for single domain
5. Wildcard Certificate --->> used for multiple sub-domains (*.devsecopswithshri.site)
   

